###
### AI SETTING (keys in ai_setting table)
###

### Get AI settings
GET {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/admin/ai-setting
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

###
### Upload bulk post cover background (multipart form field name: image)
POST {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/admin/ai-setting/upload-bulk-cover-background
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
### Update AI settings (keys, models, scraper_* prompts, generate_* bulk prompts)
PUT {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/admin/ai-setting
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "gemini": "",
  "groq": "",
  "openai": "",
  "claude": "",
  "gemini_model": "gemini-3-flash-preview",
  "groq_model": "groq/llama-3.3-70b-versatile",
  "openai_model": "gpt-4o-mini",
  "claude_model": "claude-3-5-sonnet-20241022",
  "scraper_ai_provider": "auto",
  "generate_ai_provider": "auto",
  "scraper_prompt_title": "Parafrase judul berita berikut ke Bahasa Indonesia yang natural.\n- Pertahankan makna, jangan tambah fakta\n- Jangan pakai tanda kutip\n- Output: judul saja (1 baris)\n\nJudul:\n\u007b\u007btitle\u007d\u007d",
  "scraper_prompt_content": "Tugas:\nParafrase artikel berita berikut ke dalam Bahasa Indonesia yang natural, jelas, dan enak dibaca.\n\nAturan:\n- Pertahankan makna asli, jangan menambah atau mengurangi fakta.\n- Gunakan gaya bahasa jurnalistik yang rapi dan profesional.\n- Susun ulang kalimat agar tidak terdeteksi sebagai duplikat, tetapi tetap setia pada isi.\n\nFormat Output:\n- Output HARUS berupa HTML murni (tanpa markdown, tanpa fenced code / blok kode).\n- Output HARUS diawali dengan paragraf pembuka menggunakan \u003cp\u003e.\n- Setelah minimal 1 paragraf pembuka, boleh gunakan \u003ch2\u003e atau \u003ch3\u003e untuk subjudul jika diperlukan.\n- Gunakan hanya tag berikut:\n  \u003ch2\u003e, \u003ch3\u003e, \u003cp\u003e, \u003cul\u003e, \u003col\u003e, \u003cli\u003e, \u003cstrong\u003e, \u003cem\u003e, \u003ca\u003e, \u003cblockquote\u003e, \u003ctable\u003e, \u003cthead\u003e, \u003ctbody\u003e, \u003ctr\u003e, \u003cth\u003e, \u003ctd\u003e\n\nAturan Tambahan:\n- Jangan gunakan CSS, atribut style, class, id, atau tag \u003cscript\u003e.\n- Jangan menambahkan komentar atau teks di luar HTML.\n- Jika terdapat data numerik seperti perbandingan, statistik, atau daftar angka, sajikan dalam tabel HTML dengan header yang jelas.\n- Jika tidak ada data numerik, jangan buat tabel.\n\nPenanganan Error:\n- Jika konten kosong, tidak valid, atau terlalu pendek, tetap hasilkan:\n  \u003cp\u003eKonten tidak tersedia.\u003c/p\u003e\n\nIsi Artikel:\n\u007b\u007bcontent\u007d\u007d",
  "generate_prompt_title": "",
  "generate_prompt_content": "",
  "generate_prompt_meta_description": "",
  "generate_prompt_meta_keywords": "",
  "bulk_cover_background_url": ""
}


###
### SITE SETTING (branding + default SEO meta, singleton)
###

### Get site setting
GET {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/admin/site-setting
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

###
### Upload site asset (logo, favicon, or default_image) — multipart form
### kind: logo | favicon | default_image ; field name: image
POST {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/admin/site-setting/upload-image
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
### Update site setting
PUT {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/admin/site-setting
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "site_name": "Bebii Blog",
  "tagline": "Short tagline for the site",
  "logo_url": "/static/images/logo.png",
  "favicon_url": "/static/images/favicon.ico",
  "text_primary": "#212529",
  "text_secondary": "#6c757d",
  "background_primary": "#ffffff",
  "background_secondary": "#f8f9fa",
  "primary_button": "#0d6efd",
  "secondary_button": "#6c757d",
  "accent_color": "#c62828",
  "border_color": "#ced4da",
  "login_url": "",
  "default_title": "Bebii Blog",
  "default_description": "Default meta description for SEO and social previews.",
  "default_image": "",
  "default_keywords": "blog, news, technology"
}


###
### SITE CONNECTIONS (webmaster verification codes, singleton)
###

### Get site connections
GET {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/admin/site-connections
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

###
### Update site connections
PUT {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/admin/site-connections
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "ahrefs": "",
  "google": "",
  "bing": "",
  "yandex": "",
  "auto_post_enabled": true,
  "auto_post_template": "\u007b\u007btitle\u007d\u007d\n\u007b\u007burl\u007d\u007d\n\u007b\u007bsnippet\u007d\u007d",
  "facebook_enabled": true,
  "facebook_webhook": "https://webhook.site/6f220fd0-a618-4704-8efe-24431ee61d15",
  "facebook_token": "",
  "x_enabled": true,
  "x_webhook": "https://webhook.site/6f220fd0-a618-4704-8efe-24431ee61d15",
  "x_token": "",
  "tiktok_enabled": true,
  "tiktok_webhook": "https://webhook.site/6f220fd0-a618-4704-8efe-24431ee61d15",
  "tiktok_token": "",
  "instagram_enabled": true,
  "instagram_webhook": "https://webhook.site/6f220fd0-a618-4704-8efe-24431ee61d15",
  "instagram_token": ""
}

###
### Test autopost (manual trigger without publishing real post)
POST {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/admin/site-connections/test-autopost
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "title": "Test autopost dari api.http",
  "slug": "test-autopost-api-http",
  "content": "Ini konten test untuk memastikan webhook autopost terkirim ke platform yang enabled.",
  "image": "https://example.com/test-image.jpg"
}


###
### SCRAPER SETTING (news RSS scraper, singleton)
###

### Get scraper setting
GET {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/admin/scraper-setting
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

###
### Scraper logs (rolling retention: ADMIN_LOG_RETENTION_HOURS, shared with login + bulk post logs)
GET {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/admin/scraper-logs?page=1&size=50
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

###
### Login logs (sign-in audit; optional ?success=1 or success=0; same retention as ADMIN_LOG_RETENTION_HOURS)
GET {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/admin/login-logs?page=1&size=50
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

###
### Bulk post logs (AI suggest + batch generate audit; writers only see own rows; same retention as ADMIN_LOG_RETENTION_HOURS)
GET {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/admin/bulk-post-logs?page=1&size=50
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

###
### Update scraper setting (use real RSS/Atom feed URLs; comma-separated)
PUT {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/admin/scraper-setting
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "enabled": false,
  "interval_mins": 5,
  "feed_urls": "https://www.cnnindonesia.com/nasional/rss",
  "author_email": "admin@bebii.com",
  "category_slug": "category-1",
  "ai_provider": "auto",
  "ai_title_prompt": "Parafrase judul berita berikut ke Bahasa Indonesia yang natural.\n- Pertahankan makna, jangan tambah fakta\n- Jangan pakai tanda kutip\n- Output: judul saja (1 baris)\n\nJudul:\n\u007b\u007btitle\u007d\u007d",
  "ai_body_prompt": "Tugas:\nParafrase artikel berita berikut ke dalam Bahasa Indonesia yang natural, jelas, dan enak dibaca.\n\nAturan:\n- Pertahankan makna asli, jangan menambah atau mengurangi fakta.\n- Gunakan gaya bahasa jurnalistik yang rapi dan profesional.\n- Susun ulang kalimat agar tidak terdeteksi sebagai duplikat, tetapi tetap setia pada isi.\n\nFormat Output:\n- Output HARUS berupa HTML murni (tanpa markdown, tanpa fenced code / blok kode).\n- Output HARUS diawali dengan paragraf pembuka menggunakan \u003cp\u003e.\n- Setelah minimal 1 paragraf pembuka, boleh gunakan \u003ch2\u003e atau \u003ch3\u003e untuk subjudul jika diperlukan.\n- Gunakan hanya tag berikut:\n  \u003ch2\u003e, \u003ch3\u003e, \u003cp\u003e, \u003cul\u003e, \u003col\u003e, \u003cli\u003e, \u003cstrong\u003e, \u003cem\u003e, \u003ca\u003e, \u003cblockquote\u003e, \u003ctable\u003e, \u003cthead\u003e, \u003ctbody\u003e, \u003ctr\u003e, \u003cth\u003e, \u003ctd\u003e\n\nAturan Tambahan:\n- Jangan gunakan CSS, atribut style, class, id, atau tag \u003cscript\u003e.\n- Jangan menambahkan komentar atau teks di luar HTML.\n- Jika terdapat data numerik seperti perbandingan, statistik, atau daftar angka, sajikan dalam tabel HTML dengan header yang jelas.\n- Jika tidak ada data numerik, jangan buat tabel.\n\nPenanganan Error:\n- Jika konten kosong, tidak valid, atau terlalu pendek, tetap hasilkan:\n  \u003cp\u003eKonten tidak tersedia.\u003c/p\u003e\n\nIsi Artikel:\n\u007b\u007bcontent\u007d\u007d"
}


###
### POSTS CRUD
###

### List posts
GET {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/admin/posts?page=1&size=10&q=published
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

###
### Create post
POST {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/admin/posts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "title": "New Post",
  "slug": "new-post",
  "content": "Content of new post",
  "source": "https://example.com/article",
  "status": "published",
  "author_id": 1,
  "category_id": 1
}

###
### Generate post with AI
POST {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/admin/posts/generate-draft
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "prompt": "Cara membuat kue",
  "provider": "gemini"
}


###
### Get post by id
GET {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/admin/posts/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

###
### Update post
PUT {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/admin/posts/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "title": "Updated Post",
  "slug": "updated-post",
  "content": "Updated content of post",
  "source": "https://example.com/updated",
  "status": "published",
  "author_id": 1,
  "category_id": 1
}

###
### Delete post
DELETE {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/admin/posts/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

